      "content": "\"let go\"? that sounds so much more peaceful than what i'm actually feeling. right now it just feels like i'm stuck in a loop of existing for no reason. if the journey was the only thing that mattered, and the journey is over, then what am i supposed to do with the rest of my life? it feels like there's no point in even trying to find a new reason to wake up.",
